Import-only Kaggle kernel that attaches the competition + our datasets, pip installs
--no-index from the competition arc_agi_3_wheels (the rerun's exact deps, internet off),
loads the real Agent base from the competition-provided framework, and imports
make_carnot_agent — reporting whether jax/numpy are preinstalled on the image so we know
if the real submission imports clean or needs a staged deps-wheels dataset.

